  "Description__c": "Standard Campaign fields only, so there is nothing to build: Start Date and End Date draw each campaign as a bar, grouped by Type, colored by Status, with the owner's initials. On an App page it shows every campaign; on a parent campaign's record page, its child campaigns. Campaigns run every day of the week, so Skip weekends is off. Aborted campaigns are hidden, and their status pill brings them back. Dragging a bar changes the dates, which needs the Marketing User checkbox."
